flowchart TD
    A[Authenticated request] --> B{JWT signature and expiry valid?}
    B -- No --> X[401 SESSION_EXPIRED]
    B -- Yes --> C[Load user with Google identity and whitelist]
    C --> D{User ACTIVE and authVersion matches?}
    D -- No --> Y[401 SESSION_REVOKED]
    D -- Yes --> E{Session method}
    E -- GOOGLE --> F{Identity matches and whitelist ACTIVE?}
    F -- No --> Y
    F -- Yes --> R[Continue existing resource and workspace authorization]
    E -- PASSWORD --> H{Local credential has temporary password?}
    H -- No --> R
    H -- Yes --> I{auth/me or auth/change-password?}
    I -- Yes --> R
    I -- No --> J[403 PASSWORD_CHANGE_REQUIRED]
